    // app catalog descriptions, and the two billing rate-card labels. Same
    // mechanism as the autonomy labels above: the engine translates any text
    // node whose trimmed text is a DICT key, so an entry is the whole fix.
    // NOT here on purpose, and exempted in the gate: the `name` of each field
    // is an environment variable the operator copies (CF_Token), and two hints
    // are literal example values (an acme-dns URL, the OVH endpoint list).
    // Translating either would be worse than leaving it in English.
